<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

```
<title>Verify Your Email</title>

<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background-color: #f4f7f9;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    color: #1f2937;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 40px auto;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .header {
    background-color: #0f766e;
    padding: 28px 30px;
    text-align: center;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .header h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 24px;
  }

  .content {
    padding: 35px 30px;
  }

  .content h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    font-size: 22px;
  }

  .message {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #4b5563;
  }

  .otp-box {
    margin: 30px 0;
    padding: 22px;
    background-color: #f0fdfa;
    border: 1px dashed #0f766e;
    border-radius: 10px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .otp-label {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #6b7280;
  }

  .otp {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 34px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 8px;
    color: #0f766e;
  }

  .expiry {
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #6b7280;
  }

  .security-box {
    margin-top: 25px;
    padding: 15px;
    background-color: #fff7ed;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #9a3412;
  }

  .footer {
    padding: 20px 30px;
    background-color: #f9fafb;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #6b7280;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .container {
      margin: 15px;
    }

    .content,
    .header,
    .footer {
      padding-left: 20px;
      padding-right: 20px;
    }

    .otp {
      font-size: 28px;
      letter-spacing: 6px;
    }
  }
</style>
```

  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="container">

```
  <!-- Header -->
  <div class="header">
    <h1>PH Healthcare System</h1>
  </div>

  <!-- Content -->
  <div class="content">
    <h2>Welcome, <%= name %>!</h2>

    <p class="message">
      Thank you for creating your patient account with
      PH Healthcare System.
    </p>

    <p class="message">
      To complete your registration and activate your account,
      please verify your email address using the OTP below.
    </p>

    <!-- OTP -->
    <div class="otp-box">
      <p class="otp-label">Your Verification Code</p>

      <p class="otp">
        <%= otpValue %>
      </p>

      <p class="expiry">
        This OTP will expire in
        <strong><%= expiresIn %></strong> minutes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Security Notice -->
    <div class="security-box">
      <strong>Security Notice:</strong>
      Never share this verification code with anyone.
      If you did not create an account with PH Healthcare System,
      you can safely ignore this email.
    </div>

    <p class="message" style="margin-top: 30px;">
      Once your email is verified, you will be able to access
      your patient account and use our healthcare services.
    </p>

    <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
      Regards,<br />
      <strong>PH Healthcare System Team</strong>
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <div class="footer">
    <p>
      This is an automated email. Please do not reply to this message.
    </p>

    <p>
      © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> PH Healthcare System.
      All rights reserved.
    </p>
  </div>

</div>
```

  </body>
</html>
